-\\n\\nCrooked Plow by Itamar Vieira Junior\\n\\n-\\n\\nKairos by Jenny Erpenbeck\\n\\n-\\n\\nThe ... \",\"title\":\"https://bookclubs.com/blog/2023-2024-book-awards-and-book-prize-winners\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d46\"},\"ref\":\"d46\",\"snippet\":\" ... His other translations include Kyung-Sook Shin's The Court Dancer and I Went to See My Father, Hwang Sok-yong's The Prisoner, and Baek Sehee's I Want to Die but I Want to Eat Tteokbokki. He has taught at the British Centre for Literary Translation ... \",\"title\":\"https://wordswithoutborders.org/read/article/2025-01/making-space-for-each-other-anton-hur-on-toward-eternity-translation-and-immortality-mandana-chaffa/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d47\"},\"ref\":\"d47\",\"snippet\":\" ... 1946 by Hwang Kee\\n\\nHan Moo Kwan - est. 1954 by Lee Kyo-Yoon\\n\\nJung Do Kwan - est. 1956 by Lee Yong-Woo\\n\\nChung Do Kwan - est. 1944 by Lee Won-Kuk\\n\\nChang Moo Kwan - est. 1946 by Yoon Byung-In\\n\\nJi Do Kwan - est. 1946 by Chun Sang ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.nbtkda.com/about-tkd\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d48\"},\"ref\":\"d48\",\"snippet\":\" ... Kim developed a personality cult over his nearly 46-year leadership which extended to his family, including his mother Kang Pan Sok (known as the \\\"mother of Korea\\\"), his brother Kim Yong-ju (\\\"the revolutionary fighter\\\") and his first wife Kim Jong Suk (the \\\"mother of the revolution ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_family_(North_Korea)\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action